<info><name>A7V · Portugal · Lisbon Film Rooftops</name><description>Alfama from a miradouro on film: pale washed-out sky and river, brick-brown terracotta, creamy whitewash, dense chocolate-brown shadows, olive pines, strong grain. Recipe: House recipe matched to @morganitogram's Lisbon photos (Instagram). Typical exposure comp. +1/3 to +2/3.</description></info>
